    b: "A fire occurred in the premises of Sri G. Venkatesh on 1.4.2023, destroying a considerable part of the stock; salvaged stock was ₹28,000. He had a fire insurance policy for ₹17,10,000. Given: Purchases for 2022 ₹9,38,000, Sales for 2022 ₹11,60,000, Stock on 1.1.2022 ₹1,44,000, Stock on 31.12.2022 ₹2,42,000, Wages paid during 2022 ₹1,00,000; Purchases from 1.1.23 to 1.4.23 ₹1,82,000, Sales from 1.1.23 to 1.4.23 [stated as] ₹24,00,000 [likely ₹2,40,000], Wages paid 1.1.23 to 1.4.23 ₹1,80,000. In June 2022 he lost uninsured consigned goods worth ₹50,000. Stock till end of calendar year 2021 was valued at cost less 10%; from 2022, closing stock was valued by adding 10% to cost. Critically assess and advise the insurance claim for the loss of stock by fire. [7]",
