        b: "Computation of Taxable Salary of Mr. R Singh for the A.Y. 2024-25:\n- Basic: ₹ 60,000 x 12 = ₹ 7,20,000\n- Dearness Allowance: ₹ 20,000 x 12 = ₹ 2,40,000\n- Medical Allowance: ₹ 2,000 x 12 = ₹ 24,000\n- Perquisite - Electric Bill: ₹ 20,000 - ₹ 5,000 = ₹ 15,000\n- Perquisite - Car Facility: (₹ 1,800 + ₹ 900) x 12 = ₹ 32,400\n- Perquisite - LIC premium paid: ₹ 40,000\n- Perquisite - Professional Tax: ₹ 2,400\n- Contribution to RPF in excess of 12%: (14% - 12%) of ₹ 9,60,000 = ₹ 19,200\n- Interest on RPF in excess of 9.5%: ₹ 12,100 - ₹ 10,450 = ₹ 1,650\nGross Taxable Salary: ₹ 10,94,650\nLess Deduction u/s 16(ia) Standard Deduction: ₹ 50,000\nLess Deduction u/s 16(iii) Professional Tax: NA (Not available in Default tax regime)\nTaxable Salary: ₹ 10,44,650"
