        b: "Computation of Net Income of X & Co. for A.Y. 2024-25:\n- Total Turnover: ₹ 1,57,80,000\n- Less Deductions:\n  * Salary and interest to partners: ₹ 60,000\n  * Salary to employees: ₹ 4,90,000\n  * Depreciation: ₹ 2,70,000\n  * Cost of materials used: ₹ 1,20,90,000\n  * Other expenses: ₹ 13,45,000\n- Total Deductions: ₹ 1,42,55,000\n- Net Profit before other incomes: ₹ 15,25,000\n- Add Taxable Interest Income: ₹ 90,000\n- Add Long Term Capital Gain: ₹ 1,40,000\n- Less Deduction under sec. 80G: ₹ 15,000\n- Net Income of X & Co. for A.Y. 2024-25: ₹ 17,40,000 and Total Income: ₹ 14,27,000",
